Hello,

I have updated the snd-bluez-sco driver to work with Linux 2.6.4. It's now
called snd-bt-sco. You can find more info on the following web page:

   http://www.dcs.gla.ac.uk/~jp/snd-bt-sco/

Please note that I am unable to provide support for this software. Please
use the community resources (such as mailing lists) to get help from other
people how have had success.

Good luck!

